    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/3c5dc9e7020a6992cd60b7b70f192f07.avif?t=1755108757\" width=608 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Mayor Dotsworth bring nature and excitement to the town in My Tiny Park! Ensure biodiversity, balance the books, and create amazing green spaces!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/e3a470b447f29e3e36c310df15a3931a.poster.avif?t=1755108757\" width=608 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/e3a470b447f29e3e36c310df15a3931a.webm?t=1755108757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build over 100 different objects to make your park stand out, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playground Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food and Drink Stalls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statues and Monuments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your attractions with custom paint colors and designs!\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/4e8c6a764154fe866bd9c3a990a8327c.poster.avif?t=1755108757\" width=608 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/4e8c6a764154fe866bd9c3a990a8327c.webm?t=1755108757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant trees, flowers and more!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract animals to your park by creating and maintaining habitats, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foxes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raccoons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More!</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/39c00f4bbaf64c54fb8553d18a33e9d4.poster.avif?t=1755108757\" width=608 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/39c00f4bbaf64c54fb8553d18a33e9d4.webm?t=1755108757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new items and attractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Finances and Utilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Community Events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/3c5dc9e7020a6992cd60b7b70f192f07.avif?t=1755108757\" width=608 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Mayor Dotsworth bring nature and excitement to the town in My Tiny Park! Ensure biodiversity, balance the books, and create amazing green spaces!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/e3a470b447f29e3e36c310df15a3931a.poster.avif?t=1755108757\" width=608 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/e3a470b447f29e3e36c310df15a3931a.webm?t=1755108757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build over 100 different objects to make your park stand out, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playground Equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food and Drink Stalls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Statues and Monuments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More!</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your attractions with custom paint colors and designs!\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/4e8c6a764154fe866bd9c3a990a8327c.poster.avif?t=1755108757\" width=608 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/4e8c6a764154fe866bd9c3a990a8327c.webm?t=1755108757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant trees, flowers and more!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract animals to your park by creating and maintaining habitats, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Foxes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raccoons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More!</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/39c00f4bbaf64c54fb8553d18a33e9d4.poster.avif?t=1755108757\" width=608 height=229 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578440/extras/39c00f4bbaf64c54fb8553d18a33e9d4.webm?t=1755108757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new items and attractions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Finances and Utilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold Community Events</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
